          "content": {
            "size": 11795,
            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "text": "/* ============================================================\n * shell.css — SPA 셸 레이아웃\n * 사이드바(다크) + 콘텐츠 영역 + 모바일 오버레이\n * ============================================================ */\n\n/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n * 사이드바 토큰\n * ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n:root {\n  --sb-width:        220px;\n  --sb-bg:           #0c1f3f;\n  --sb-bg-hover:     rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  --sb-bg-active:    rgba(201,168,76,0.15);\n  --sb-border:       rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n  --sb-text:         rgba(255,255,255,0.60);\n  --sb-text-hover:   rgba(255,255,255,0.90);\n  --sb-text-active:  #ffffff;\n  --sb-accent:       #c9a84c;\n  --topbar-h:        48px;\n}\n\n/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n * 전체 셸 구조\n * ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\nhtml, body { height: 100%; overflow: hidden; }\n\n.app-shell {\n  display: flex;\n  height: 100dvh;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #f0f2f5;\n}\n\n/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n * 사이드바\n * ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.sidebar {\n  width: var(--sb-width);\n  min-width: var(--sb-width);\n  height: 100dvh;\n  background: var(--sb-bg);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  z-index: 200;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n}\n\n/* 브랜드 영역 */\n.sb-brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: flex-start;\n  padding: 14px 16px 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sb-border);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.sb-brand-img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 180px;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\n.sb-brand-logo {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.sb-brand-text { display: none; }\n.sb-brand-title { display: none; }\n.sb-brand-sub   { display: none; }\n\n/* 사용자 영역 */\n.sb-user {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sb-border);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.sb-user-info { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }\n\n.sb-user-line {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--sb-text);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n}\n\n/* 네비게이션 */\n.sb-nav {\n  flex: 1;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n  padding: 6px 0;\n  scrollbar-width: thin;\n  scrollbar-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12) transparent;\n}\n\n.sb-nav::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 3px; }\n.sb-nav::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n.sb-nav::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border-radius: 2px; }\n\n/* 섹션 레이블 */\n.sb-section-label {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--sb-text);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.07em;\n  padding: 10px 14px 4px;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* 메뉴 아이템 */\n.sb-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  padding: 7px 14px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--sb-text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  transition: background 0.12s, color 0.12s;\n  user-select: none;\n  border: none;\n  background: none;\n  width: 100%;\n  text-align: left;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n}\n\n.sb-item:hover {\n  background: var(--sb-bg-hover);\n  color: var(--sb-text-hover);\n}\n\n.sb-item.active {\n  background: var(--sb-bg-active);\n  color: var(--sb-text-active);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  border-right: 2px solid var(--sb-accent);\n}\n\n.sb-item i {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 18px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* 아코디언 부모 (화살표 포함) */\n.sb-item-parent {\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.sb-item-parent .sb-item-arrow {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  margin-left: auto;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  /* flyout 방식이므로 회전 없음 */\n}\n\n.sb-item-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex: 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* 서브메뉴 — JS portal 방식 (body에 append, 위치 동적 계산) */\n.sb-submenu { display: none; } /* 원본은 숨김 */\n\n/* flyout 팝업 — JS가 body에 동적 생성 */\n.sb-flyout {\n  position: fixed;\n  z-index: 9999;\n  min-width: 160px;\n  background: #1a2744;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 6px 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n  padding: 4px 0;\n  pointer-events: auto;\n}\n\n.sb-sub-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  padding: 7px 16px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--sb-text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, color 0.1s;\n  border: none;\n  background: none;\n  width: 100%;\n  text-align: left;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.sb-sub-item:hover {\n  background: var(--sb-bg-hover);\n  color: var(--sb-text-hover);\n}\n\n.sb-sub-item.active {\n  color: var(--sb-text-active);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  background: var(--sb-bg-active);\n}\n\n.sb-sub-item i { font-size: 13px; flex-shrink: 0; width: 16px; text-align: center; }\n\n/* 권한 없는 메뉴 — 완전히 숨기지 않고 흐리게 + 자물쇠 아이콘으로 표시.\n   클릭은 여전히 가능하지만(navigate()의 권한 체크에서 알림), hover 시 강조되지 않게 해서\n   \"선택 가능한 메뉴가 아니다\"라는 걸 시각적으로 분명히 한다. */\n.sb-sub-item--disabled,\n.sb-item.sb-item--disabled {\n  opacity: 0.42;\n}\n.sb-sub-item--disabled:hover,\n.sb-item.sb-item--disabled:hover {\n  background: none;\n  color: var(--sb-text);\n}\n.sb-lock-icon {\n  margin-left: auto;\n  font-size: 11px !important;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n}\n\n/* 구분선 */\n.sb-divider {\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--sb-border);\n  margin: 6px 14px;\n}\n\n/* 뱃지 (알림 카운트) */\n.sb-badge {\n  margin-left: auto;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  height: 16px;\n  min-width: 16px;\n  padding: 0 4px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: var(--sb-accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* 하단 영역 */\n.sb-footer {\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--sb-border);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.sb-logout {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--sb-text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 6px 0;\n  transition: color 0.12s;\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  width: 100%;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.sb-logout:hover { color: var(--sb-text-hover); }\n.sb-logout i { font-size: 15px; }\n\n/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n * 메인 콘텐츠 영역\n * ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.shell-main {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  min-width: 0;\n  height: 100dvh;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* 상단바 */\n.shell-topbar {\n  height: var(--topbar-h);\n  min-height: var(--topbar-h);\n  background: #fff;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 0 20px;\n  gap: 12px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.shell-topbar-hamburger {\n  display: none;\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  color: #374151;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  padding: 4px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.shell-topbar-hamburger:hover { background: #f3f4f6; }\n\n.shell-sidebar-collapse-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  color: #6b7280;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  padding: 4px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.shell-sidebar-collapse-btn:hover { background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; }\n\n/* 사이드바 접힘 상태 — 화면폭을 더 넓게 쓰고 싶을 때. 트랜지션이 자연스럽도록\n   transform이 아니라 width/min-width를 0으로 줄인다(sidebar 자체는 flex-shrink:0\n   고정폭이라 width 애니메이션이 필요). */\n.sidebar.is-collapsed {\n  width: 0 !important;\n  min-width: 0 !important;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.sidebar { transition: width 0.2s ease, min-width 0.2s ease, transform 0.25s ease; }\n\n.shell-breadcrumb {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.shell-breadcrumb-app {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #111827;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.shell-breadcrumb-sep {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #9ca3af;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.shell-breadcrumb-page {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #6b7280;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n}\n\n.shell-topbar-right {\n  margin-left: auto;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.shell-user-chip { display: none; } /* 제거 */\n\n/* 콘텐츠 iframe 영역 */\n.shell-content {\n  flex: 1;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  background: #f0f2f5;\n}\n\n.shell-iframe {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  border: none;\n  display: block;\n  background: #f0f2f5; /* shell-content와 동일한 배경 — 로드 중 깜빡임 방지 */\n  transition: opacity 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n/* iframe 로딩 오버레이 */\n/* shell-loading 제거 — iframe visibility로 처리 */\n\n/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n * 모바일 오버레이\n * ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n.sb-overlay {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n  z-index: 190;\n}\n\n/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n * 반응형 — 모바일\n * ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .sidebar {\n    position: fixed;\n    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;\n    transform: translateX(-100%);\n    z-index: 200;\n  }\n\n  .sidebar.mobile-open {\n    transform: translateX(0);\n  }\n\n  .sb-overlay.mobile-open {\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .shell-topbar-hamburger { display: flex; }\n  .shell-sidebar-collapse-btn { display: none; }\n\n  .shell-content { height: calc(100dvh - var(--topbar-h)); }\n}\n\n/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n * iframe 내부 페이지용 — topbar 숨김 클래스\n * (각 페이지 HTML에 <body class=\"in-shell\"> 추가 시 적용)\n * ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n"
          },
