          "content": {
            "size": 5584,
            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "text": "/* ============================================================\n * assets/css/ai-assistant.css — AI 어시스턴트 위젯(플로팅 버튼 + 패널) 공용 스타일\n * [수정] 원래 이 스타일 전체가 데스크톱 app.html의 인라인 <style>에만 있었다.\n * 모바일 셸(mobile/app.html)은 AI 패널 마크업(#aiFab, #aiPanel 등)을 데스크톱과\n * 동일하게 그대로 재사용하면서도 이 인라인 스타일은 포함하지 않고 있었는데, 그 결과\n * 모바일에서 AI 탭을 열면 .ai-panel에 배경색·flex 레이아웃이 전혀 적용되지 않아\n * (모바일 전용 mobile-shell.css는 position/크기만 강제로 전체화면으로 덮어씌울 뿐,\n * 배경·레이아웃까지 정의하지는 않는다) 투명한 패널 위에 헤더/본문/입력창이 겹쳐\n * 보이고 뒤에 있는 페이지 내용까지 비쳐 보이는 \"화면 깨짐\" 버그가 있었다.\n * 데스크톱과 모바일이 똑같은 스타일을 공유하도록 별도 파일로 분리한다.\n * ============================================================ */\n\n.ai-fab {\n  position: fixed; right: 24px; bottom: 24px; z-index: 9000;\n  width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; border: none;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#0a1e3d,#1a3a6e);\n  color: #fff; font-size: 22px; cursor: grab;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(10,30,61,0.35);\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;\n  touch-action: none; user-select: none;\n}\n.ai-fab:hover { transform: scale(1.06); }\n.ai-fab.ai-fab-dragging {\n  cursor: grabbing; transition: none;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(10,30,61,0.5); transform: scale(1.1);\n}\n.ai-fab-badge {\n  position: absolute; top: -4px; right: -4px; min-width: 18px; height: 18px;\n  padding: 0 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: #dc2626; color: #fff;\n  font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #fff; pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.ai-alert-banner {\n  align-self: stretch; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n  background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; color: #991b1b;\n  border-radius: 10px; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;\n}\n.ai-alert-banner:hover { background: #fee2e2; }\n.ai-alert-banner i { font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n.ai-panel {\n  position: fixed; right: 24px; bottom: 88px; z-index: 9000;\n  width: 360px; height: 480px; max-height: calc(100vh - 120px);\n  background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n}\n.ai-panel-header {\n  background: #0a1e3d; color: #fff; padding: 12px 14px;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.ai-msg-suggestions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; align-self: flex-start; max-width: 100%; }\n.ai-msg-suggestion-btn {\n  border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #fff; color: #0a1e3d;\n  border-radius: 14px; padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 11.5px; cursor: pointer;\n}\n.ai-msg-suggestion-btn:hover { background: #eef2f7; }\n.ai-panel-icon-btn {\n  background: transparent; border: none; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);\n  cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px; padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 4px;\n}\n.ai-panel-icon-btn:hover { color: #fff; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }\n.ai-panel-body {\n  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\n  background: #f8fafc;\n}\n.ai-msg {\n  max-width: 85%; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5;\n  white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\n}\n.ai-msg-user { align-self: flex-end; background: #0a1e3d; color: #fff; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; }\n.ai-msg-bot  { align-self: flex-start; background: #eef2f7; color: #1f2937; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; }\n.ai-msg-err  { align-self: flex-start; background: #fef2f2; color: #991b1b; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; }\n.ai-msg-loading { align-self: flex-start; background: #eef2f7; color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic; }\n\n/* 마크다운 렌더링 콘텐츠(표/목록/코드) 스타일 — 좁은 말풍선 안에서도 보기 좋게 */\n.ai-msg-bot table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 6px 0; font-size: 11.5px; }\n.ai-msg-bot th, .ai-msg-bot td { border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; }\n.ai-msg-bot th { background: #e5e9f0; font-weight: 700; }\n.ai-msg-bot ul, .ai-msg-bot ol { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 18px; }\n.ai-msg-bot p { margin: 0 0 6px; }\n.ai-msg-bot p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.ai-msg-bot code { background: #e5e9f0; border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 4px; font-size: 11px; }\n.ai-msg-bot strong { color: #0a1e3d; }\n.ai-panel-footer {\n  display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; flex-shrink: 0; background: #fff;\n}\n.ai-panel-footer input {\n  flex: 1; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 20px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 12.5px; outline: none;\n}\n.ai-panel-footer input:focus { border-color: #0a1e3d; }\n.ai-panel-footer button {\n  width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: none; background: #0a1e3d; color: #fff;\n  cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n}\n.ai-panel-footer button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .ai-panel { width: calc(100vw - 24px); right: 12px; bottom: 80px; height: 60vh; }\n  .ai-fab { right: 16px; bottom: 16px; }\n}\n"
          },
