          "content": {
            "size": 3042,
            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "text": "/**\n * assets/css/ag-grid-custom.css\n * AG Grid 공통 커스텀 스타일 — 모든 그리드 페이지에서 공유\n * 적용 순서: ag-grid.min.css → ag-theme-alpine.min.css → ag-grid-custom.css\n */\n\n/* ── 테마 변수 ── */\n.ag-theme-alpine {\n  --ag-font-size: 11px;\n  --ag-font-family: \"Pretendard\", \"Noto Sans KR\", sans-serif;\n  --ag-header-background-color: #f8fafc;\n  --ag-header-foreground-color: #4b5563;\n  --ag-border-color: #e5e7eb;\n  --ag-row-border-color: #f0f0f0;\n  --ag-background-color: #fff;\n  --ag-odd-row-background-color: #fff;\n  --ag-row-hover-color: #f0f5ff;\n  --ag-selected-row-background-color: #eff6ff;\n  --ag-cell-horizontal-padding: 8px;\n}\n\n/* ── 레이아웃 ── */\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-root-wrapper {\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-body-viewport {\n  overflow-x: hidden !important;\n  overflow-y: auto !important;\n}\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-body-horizontal-scroll {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n/* ── 헤더 ── */\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-header {\n  font-size: 11px;\n}\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-header-cell-text {\n  font-size: 11px !important;\n  font-family: \"Pretendard\", \"Noto Sans KR\", sans-serif !important;\n}\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-header-cell-label {\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n/* 헤더 정렬 유틸 클래스 */\n.ag-left-header   .ag-header-cell-label { justify-content: flex-start !important; }\n.ag-right-header  .ag-header-cell-label { justify-content: flex-end   !important; }\n.ag-center-header .ag-header-cell-label { justify-content: center     !important; }\n\n/* ── 셀 ── */\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-cell {\n  font-size: 11px !important;\n  font-family: \"Pretendard\", \"Noto Sans KR\", sans-serif !important;\n  border-right: 1px solid #e5e7eb !important;\n}\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-cell:last-child {\n  border-right: none !important;\n}\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-cell * {\n  font-size: 11px !important;\n  font-family: \"Pretendard\", \"Noto Sans KR\", sans-serif !important;\n}\n\n/* ── 인라인 편집 (editable 셀) ── */\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-cell-editor input,\n.ag-theme-alpine .ag-cell-editor select {\n  height: 100%;\n  width: 100%;\n  border: none;\n  outline: 2px solid #3b82f6;\n  padding: 0 6px;\n  font-size: 11px !important;\n  font-family: \"Pretendard\", \"Noto Sans KR\", sans-serif !important;\n  background: #fff;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n/* ── 그리드 내 공통 버튼 ── */\n.tbl-btn {\n  height: 22px;\n  padding: 0 8px;\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  background: #fff;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-size: 11px !important;\n  font-family: \"Pretendard\", \"Noto Sans KR\", sans-serif !important;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n.tbl-btn:hover { background: #f9fafb; }\n/* 의료장비 페이지(assets/css/pages/equipment-list.css) 기준으로 통일 */\n.tbl-btn--primary { background: #111827; border-color: #111827; color: #fff; }\n.tbl-btn--primary:hover { background: #1f2937; }\n.tbl-btn--danger  { border-color: #fca5a5; color: #dc2626; }\n.tbl-btn--danger:hover  { background: #fef2f2; }"
          },
